## Mathematical Formulations Included

### Optimization
- SGD: $w_{t+1} = w_t - \alpha \nabla L(w_t)$
- Momentum: $v_t = \beta v_{t-1} + \nabla L(w_t)$
- Adam: First and second moment estimates with bias correction
- Learning rate schedules: Linear, exponential, cosine annealing

### Neural Networks
- Linear layer: $y = xW^T + b$
- Activation: ReLU, sigmoid, tanh, GELU formulas
- Batch norm: $\hat{x} = \frac{x - \mu}{\sqrt{\sigma^2 + \epsilon}}$
- Dropout: Random feature ablation with scaling

### Attention
- Scaled dot-product: $\text{Attention}(Q,K,V) = \text{softmax}\frac{QK^T}{\sqrt{d_k}}V$
- Multi-head: Parallel attention with different projection spaces

### Information Theory
- Cross-entropy: $H(p,q) = -\sum p_i \log q_i$
- KL divergence: $D_{KL}(p||q) = \sum p_i \log \frac{p_i}{q_i}$
- Entropy: $H(p) = -\sum p_i \log p_i$

